1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:04,249
Three rings. Two superstars. One feud that split a dynasty.

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:08,753
Shaq and Kobe clashed over leadership, shot selection, and work habits.

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:13,246
But on the court? Three straight championships. An unstoppable partnership.

4
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:17,740
Off the court, public criticism kept the tension alive. Winning wasn't enough.

5
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:22,230
After the Finals loss, Shaq went to Miami. Kobe stayed.

6
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:26,747
Both won again: Shaq in Miami, and Kobe twice in L.A.

7
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:30,427
They later shared All-Star MVP honors.

8
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:35,727
If they'd stayed together, how many more rings could they have won?
